		{
			dependencies: ["10583B7DED57F345"]
			description: [
				"Deep Aether's own contribution: the &b&lEye of the Storm&r, a serpent of cloud and lightning coiled in the Brass Dungeon."
				""
				"&c&lCelestial Core component four.&r The &6Brass Dungeon Key&r drops from this fight and nowhere else. &lKeep it.&r"
				""
				"&e&lThe fight:&r a segmented storm-serpent that circles the arena in the air and dives through it. Like the Slider it commits to a line, but unlike the Slider it does so in three dimensions."
				"&7- &fThe head is the target.&7 The trailing segments are armour, not health."
				"&7- &fIt calls lightning&7 on your position - keep moving, never stand still to drink a potion."
				"&7- &fRanged is viable here&7 for once, because it spends most of the fight out of reach."
				"&7- &fBuild cover.&7 A two-block wall breaks line of sight on the storm arrows."
				""
				"&8This is the last key. With Bronze, Silver, Gold and Brass in hand you need only one more component - a &7Monstrous Horn&r from Cataclysm's Netherite Monstrosity - and the Celestial Core is yours."
			]
			icon: "deep_aether:brass_dungeon_key"
			id: "0DABDEE4D0A6CA1A"
